would be created    drivers/gcs/gcs.go
would be created    drivers/README.md
would be created    drivers/drivers.gen.go
-- new.out --
created    drivers/gcs/gcs.go
created    drivers/gcs/cache.go
created    drivers/README.md
created    drivers/drivers.gen.go

Next, implement New in drivers/gcs/gcs.go.
-- stdin.out --
created    drivers/mem/mem.go
skipped    drivers/README.md
updated    drivers/drivers.gen.go

Next, implement New in drivers/mem/mem.go.
-- diff.out --
would be created    drivers/blob/blob.go
skipped    drivers/README.md
would be updated    drivers/drivers.gen.go

